T*
(k_xx = sqrt\(I_xx / A\) = sqrt\( 1.7329 * 10^8 / 17,592.92 \) = sqrt\(9850.0\) = 99.25 mm.) Tj
T*
(Conclusion: I_xx = 1.733 * 10^8 mm^4; J = 3.466 * 10^8 mm^4; k_xx = 99.25 mm.) Tj
